sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Net as Domain B: network / clock / OS
    participant Gate as Domain A admissibility gate
    participant T as Domain A transition T(S_t,I_t)
    participant Enc as Canonical encoder
    participant Hash as Domain-tagged hash
    participant Pal as Domain B observer

    Net->>Gate: externally signed candidate input I_t
    Note over Net,Gate: clocks, entropy, and arrival order are not consensus inputs
    Gate->>Gate: verify signatures, bounds, slot order, and metric monotonicity
    alt input admissible
        Gate->>T: admissible I_t only
        T->>T: checked arithmetic and projected Lyapunov evaluation
        alt halt condition or violation
            T-->>Enc: absorbing halted state
        else valid transition
            T-->>Enc: next deterministic state S_{t+1}
        end
        Enc->>Hash: canonical bytes
        Hash-->>Pal: state root / halt signal
    else input invalid
        Gate-->>Pal: reject or halt reason
    end
